{% extends "layout.njk" %}
{% from "blog/_macros.njk" import postList %}
{% set docTitle = "Pastoral Leadership Coaching for Pastors | The Hardy Group" %}
{% set description = "Pastoral leadership coaching and church board consulting for lead pastors from Dick Hardy and Jonathan Hardy. Lead well and reach more people." %}

{% block content %}
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-text">
    <p class="eyebrow">Pastoral Leadership Coaching</p>
    <h1>Helping Leaders<br>Reach More People</h1>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <p>From leadership training to practical planning resources, everything we create is designed to help you lead well and leave a lasting legacy.</p>
    <div class="names">Dick Hardy <span>&nbsp;·&nbsp;</span> Jonathan Hardy</div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-photo">
    <picture>
      <source srcset="/images/dick-and-jonathan-hardy.webp" type="image/webp">
      <img src="/images/dick-and-jonathan-hardy.png" alt="Dick Hardy and Jonathan Hardy, co-founders of The Hardy Group" width="800" height="899" fetchpriority="high">
    </picture>
    <div class="photo-overlay"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section" id="pastoral-leadership">
  <div class="split">
    <picture class="split-photo">
      <source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="/images/speaking/jonathan-stage-wide.jpg" width="1000" height="667">
      <img src="/images/speaking/jonathan-stage-tall.jpg" alt="Jonathan Hardy speaking from a stage" width="800" height="1200" loading="lazy">
    </picture>
    <div class="split-text">
      <h2>Pastoral Leadership</h2>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <p>Shepherding a congregation asks a pastor to lead in a dozen directions at once — casting vision one hour, sitting with a grieving family the next. We work with pastors to build the clarity, habits, and decision-making that keep pace with the calling, so leading well doesn't come at the cost of leading long.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section tint" id="church-board-leadership">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <h2>Church Board Leadership</h2>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <p>A healthy board changes what a church is able to accomplish. We work directly with elders, deacons, and trustees to clarify roles, strengthen governance practices, and build the kind of trust between board and pastor that lets a congregation move forward with confidence instead of friction.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section" id="volunteers">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <h2>Navigating the Gift of Volunteers</h2>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <p>Every volunteer who serves is answering a call, not filling a slot. We help ministry leaders see volunteers as a gift to be stewarded — matching people to the work that fits their gifts, building systems that sustain them, and turning occasional helpers into long-term partners in ministry.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section tint" id="personal-coaching">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <h2>Personal Coaching</h2>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <p>Some seasons call for a guide, not just a resource. Through one-on-one coaching, Dick and Jonathan Hardy work directly with pastors and ministry leaders to think through hard decisions, plan next steps, and grow into the leader their calling requires.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/personal-coaching">Learn How Lead Pastor Coaching Works</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section" id="ministry-blogs">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <h2>Ministry Blogs</h2>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <p>We write regularly about the real work of ministry leadership — the decisions, the tensions, and the small habits that make a lasting difference. Click Blog in the menu above any time to read the latest, or use the button below to head there now.</p>
    {{ postList(latestPosts, "Latest articles") }}
    <a class="btn-gold" href="/blog">Read the Ministry Blog</a>
  </div>
</section>
{% endblock %}
